{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"جمل أطول ومفردات أقلّ شيوعًا. الكلمات الجديدة في معظمها مشروحة أدناه."},{"btype":"example","text":"I don't care for him.","note":"لا يهمني أمره."},{"btype":"example","text":"I didn't care anymore.","note":"لم أعد أبالي."},{"btype":"example","text":"Sami doesn't even care.","note":"سامي لا يأبه حتّى."},{"btype":"example","text":"I don't care about you.","note":"انا لا أهتم بك."},{"btype":"example","text":"She took care of my dog.","note":"اعتنت بكلبي."},{"btype":"example","text":"Why does he care about this?","note":"ما دخله في هذا الشأن؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Do they take care of the dog?","note":"هل يعتنون بالكلب؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Who doesn't care about money?","note":"من لا يَهمّه المال؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Sami can take care of himself.","note":"سامي قادر على الاعتناء بنفسه."},{"btype":"example","text":"He didn't care about anything.","note":"لم يكن يأبه لشيء."},{"btype":"example","text":"What do you care about my life?","note":"ما دخلك في حياتي؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"We will take care of your house.","note":"سنعتني بمنزلك."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"en","lang_name":"الإنجليزية","sentences":[{"t":"I don't care for him.","ar":"لا يهمني أمره."},{"t":"I didn't care anymore.","ar":"لم أعد أبالي."},{"t":"Sami doesn't even care.","ar":"سامي لا يأبه حتّى."},{"t":"I don't care about you.","ar":"انا لا أهتم بك."},{"t":